---
import Workspace from '../layouts/Workspace.astro';
import { ABOUT } from '../lib/workspace';
import { EMAIL, SOCIAL_LINKS, TECH_STACK } from '../data/constants';
---

<Workspace
  file={ABOUT}
  title="About | Naofal Leo Agusta"
  description="Learn more about Naofal Leo Agusta, a software engineer based in Palembang, Indonesia with expertise in front-end engineering."
  jsonLd={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Person',
    name: 'Naofal Leo Agusta',
    url: 'https://naofalleoagusta.xyz',
    jobTitle: 'Software Engineer',
    description: 'Software engineer based in Palembang, Indonesia with expertise in front-end engineering.',
    knowsAbout: ['React', 'TypeScript', 'Node.js', 'JavaScript', 'Tailwind CSS', 'GraphQL', 'Next.js'],
    sameAs: [
      'https://github.com/naofalleoagusta',
      'https://www.linkedin.com/in/naofal-leo-agusta/',
      'https://instagram.com/naofalleoagusta/',
    ],
    alumniOf: {
      '@type': 'CollegeOrUniversity',
      name: 'Parahyangan Catholic University',
      sameAs: 'https://unpar.ac.id/',
    },
    address: {
      '@type': 'PostalAddress',
      addressLocality: 'Palembang',
      addressCountry: 'ID',
    },
  }}
>
  <article class="preview px-4 py-8 sm:px-10">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      My fullname is Naofal Leo Agusta, I was born and raised in Palembang, Indonesia 🇮🇩. I've been
      working as a software engineer for the last 3 years with Computer Science Degree from
      <a href="https://unpar.ac.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Parahyangan Catholic University (UNPAR)</a>,
      Bandung, Indonesia 🇮🇩. For the last 2 years, I've been more specialized at front-end engineering.
    </p>

    <p>
      I've been lucky enough to work with several tech stack, but I would say I'm more prolific to work
      with these technologies:
    </p>

    <p class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {TECH_STACK.map((tech) => <code>{tech}</code>)}
    </p>

    <p>
      I love learning new things, because I enjoyed being fascinated by new knowledge, especially
      technology. Therefore, I'm open to learn new tech stack or programming language, for the sake of my
      employer and science. At the moment, I'm diving deep into <strong>AI agents and vibe coding</strong> —
      I love the idea of building with natural language and pairing with machines to move faster than ever.
    </p>

    <p>
      I'm currently based in Palembang, Indonesia 🇮🇩, but I've been working remotely for several startup
      in Indonesia. I'm open for remote roles across the world.
    </p>

    <h2>Quick facts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Location:</strong> Palembang, Indonesia 🇮🇩</li>
      <li><strong>Education:</strong> Computer Science — Parahyangan Catholic University (UNPAR)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Feel free to hit my email boxes: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`} class="break-all">{EMAIL}</a></p>
    <ul>
      {
        SOCIAL_LINKS.filter((link) => link.href.startsWith('http')).map((link) => (
          <li>
            <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              {link.text}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </article>
</Workspace>
